          "key": "inspection_points",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Pesticide Application inspection points",
          "items": [
            "Product identity and registration reference match the planned record",
            "Current label and any controlling supplemental directions are available",
            "Field, crop, target, method, and timing were compared to directions",
            "Applicator authorization and required supervision were reviewed",
            "Mixing, loading, and application equipment records were reviewed",
            "Calibration, nozzle, flow, and rate evidence were compared",
            "Weather and wind observations were captured at the decision point",
            "Buffers, sensitive areas, and access restrictions were reviewed",
            "Handler protection, emergency information, and supplies were reviewed",
            "Entry, harvest, notification, and retention prompts were routed"
